Maintainer: buildrules authors <buildrules@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://buildrules.dev
Description: command line of the buildrules hermetic Buck2 rules
 buildrules sets up a repository for the buildrules rules and keeps its
 generated files (Cargo, npm and Mojo packages) in step with the sources,
 offline and with pinned tools.
 .
 This is a static binary: it needs nothing else installed.
